# An article before a unit counts one only when the article says one
# ("a hora", "um dia").  "no", "na", "nos" and "nas" are the preposition
# "em" fused with the article: "Contração da preposição em e artigo ou
# pronome a" (Priberam s.v. "na").  They place something in time ("na hora
# de ir", "nos dias de semana") and name no length.  "os" and "as" are plural
# articles, and a plural article opens a plural noun, never a single unit.
no
na
nos
nas
os
as
